{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20068","headline":"寄义兴小女子 · 孟郊","name":"寄义兴小女子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南庄宅浅，所固唯疎篱。\n小女未解行，酒弟老更痴。\n家中多吴语，教尔遥可知。\n山怪夜动门，水妖时弄池。\n所忧痴酒肠，不解委曲辞。\n渔妾性崛强，耕童手皴厘。\n想兹爲襁褓，如鸟拾柴枝。\n我咏元鲁山，胸臆流甘滋。\n终当学自乳，起坐常相随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}